OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATfL announces capital's publicly
OL,4,Aowned bus company
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport for London (TfL) is setting
OL,7,Fup its own bus company to run some of
OL,8,Fthe capital's routes directly, starting
OL,9,Fwith the service between Willesden and
OL,10,FVictoria in late 2027.
OL,12,FThe line, route 6, will be the first to
OL,13,Foperate under the new Buses for London
OL,14,Fname, with four more routes to be
OL,15,Fannounced over the next year and due to
OL,16,Fstart from 2028.
OL,18,FAll of London's bus routes - around 700
OL,19,For so - are currently contracted out to
OL,20,Feight privately owned operators.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
