OL,3,GNEWSATfL announces capital's publicly
OL,4,Aowned bus company
OL,5,
OL,6,FTfL said running services itself would
OL,7,Fgive it greater control over
OL,8,Freliability and safety, and allow
OL,9,Fprofits to be reinvested into the
OL,10,Ftransport network.
